# POLLY, tour: the main flows as a new user walks them, a screenshot at each page and state (docs/ux-pass.md).
# First boot, hear something (a style, PLAY, chords live, sections), write a song (Chords, Arrange, Song
# patterns), record a part (Pattern, REC), shape the sound (Track, Mixer, tone, Master FX), save, Setup / Panel
# (no bank, a bank, a damaged one), templates, the jobs, MIDI clock in, another song.
wait 500
expect page 0
shot 01_boot.png
# ---- a style from the Song page: KNOB 1, or PRESETS
spin K1 1
wait 20
expect song1_style0 38
expect song1_style1 39
expect msg_is_STYLE 1
shot 01b_style_knob.png
turn PRESET -1
wait 20
expect song1_style1 33
wait 1400
expect tempo 105
shot 01c_style_pop.png
# ---- hear something: SEL held shows the keys' shortcuts; a template (SEL + white key), PLAY
press SEL
wait 300
expect sel_shown 0
wait 200
expect sel_shown 1
shot 02_sel_held.png
key w0 down
key w0 up
release SEL
wait 50
expect sel_shown 0
expect chord_mode 0
expect template 0
shot 03_template_msg.png
tap PLAY
wait 2000
shot 04_playing_intro.png
wait 2600
shot 05_playing_main_a.png
# CHORD mode: hold A C E
tap SEL
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 100
shot 06_chord_mode.png
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
tap SEL
# a section: Main B waits for the bar (SEL held: its key outlined on screen)
press SEL
tapkey b2
wait 500
shot 07a_sel_next_b.png
release SEL
wait 900
shot 07_next_b.png
wait 1500
expect sect 3
tap PLAY
wait 100
# stopped: the tracks are not lit
shot 08_stopped.png
# ---- write a song: Chords, Arrange, Song patterns
tap LFO
spin K1 9
spin K2 18
wait 1400
shot 10_chords.png
tap ENV
wait 1400
shot 11_arrange.png
tap ENV
wait 1400
shot 12_song_patterns.png
spin K4 1
wait 50
shot 13_style_msg.png
wait 1400
tap ENV
wait 50
shot 14_song_patterns2.png
# ---- record a part: Pattern, REC (into a style's section: a new user pattern, said)
tap SEQ
wait 1400
shot 20_pattern.png
tap PLAY
wait 2600
tap REC
wait 50
expect msg_is_RECORD 1
expect msg2_is_into_new_P01 1
shot 21_recording_msg.png
tapkey 7
wait 2100
# the Intro ended: so did the take, said
expect recording 0
expect msg2_is_section_ended 1
shot 22_record_ended.png
tap PLAY
wait 1400
tap SEQ
wait 50
shot 23_pattern_setup.png
# ---- shape the sound
tap EDIT
wait 50
shot 30_track.png
tap EDIT
wait 50
shot 31_track_keys.png
tap FX
shot 32_mixer.png
tap FX
shot 33_mixer_tone.png
tap FX
shot 34_master_fx.png
# ---- save: SAVE's light says there is something to save
tap HOME
wait 50
expect dirty 1
leds
expect lit_SAVE 1
shot 40_song_unsaved.png
tap SAVE
wait 50
expect dirty 0
leds
expect lit_SAVE 0
shot 41_saved_msg.png
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
wait 50
expect msg_is_JOBS 1
shot 42_jobs_on_song.png
tap SEQ
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
shot 43_pattern_jobs.png
tap SAVE
tap LFO
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
shot 44_song_jobs.png
tap SAVE
wait 1400
# ---- templates
tap ARP
wait 50
shot 50_templates.png
tap ARP
shot 51_copy_template.png
# ---- Setup and Panel: no bank, then a bank, then a damaged style
tap GLO
wait 1400
shot 60_setup_nobank.png
tap GLO
shot 61_panel.png
bank build/host/synth.qyi
tap GLO
wait 1400
shot 62_setup_bank.png
tap HOME
style qy:Pop
wait 1400
shot 63_song_qy.png
bank_damage 2
style qy:Rock
shot 64_damaged_msg.png
wait 1400
# ---- MIDI clock in
midi FA 00 00
clock 110
shot 70_ext_clock.png
midi FC 00 00
wait 50
# ---- another song: SEL held + PRESETS (while playing: after the stop), or the Arrange page's KNOB 4
tap PLAY
wait 200
press SEL
turn PRESET 1
release SEL
expect chord_mode 0
expect msg2_is_after_the_stop 1
shot 71_song_at_stop.png
tap PLAY
wait 2200
expect song 2
shot 72_song2.png
tap ENV
spin K4 -1
wait 50
expect song 1
shot 73_arrange_song.png
